name milsymb
category Package
revision 66697
shortdesc LaTeX package for TikZ based drawing of military symbols as per NATO APP-6(C)
relocated 1
longdesc The package offers commands to draw military symbols as per
longdesc NATO APP-6(C)
longdesc https://web.archive.org/web/20150921231042/http://armawiki.zumo
longdesc rc.de/files/NATO/APP-6(C).pdf . It has a set of commands for
longdesc drawing all symbols found in the document up to the control
longdesc measures, as well as support for custom non-standard symbols.
longdesc Control measures are planned to be included in a future
longdesc release.
runfiles size=46
 RELOC/tex/latex/milsymb/milsymb.sty
